# No API keys needed for this agent.
#
# Requirements:
#   - Ollama running locally (https://ollama.com)
#   - Internet connection for Grants.gov searches
#
# To change the AI model, edit MODEL in agent.py
# Recommended models (run in terminal to download):
#   ollama pull llama3.1        (8B, best quality, needs ~8GB RAM)
#   ollama pull llama3.2        (3B, faster, needs ~4GB RAM)
#   ollama pull mistral         (7B, good alternative, needs ~6GB RAM)
